    ))}
  </section>

  <section class="id-sources id-section" aria-labelledby="src-h2">
    <h2 id="src-h2">Sources</h2>
    <ol class="id-src-list">
      <li id="src-1">Boarman, W. I. &amp; Heinrich, B. (1999). Common Raven (<em>Corvus corax</em>). <em>The Birds of North America</em>, No. 476. — pair bonds, divorce, re-pairing.</li>
      <li id="src-2">Heinrich, B. (1989). <em>Ravens in Winter</em>. Summit Books. — territorial pairs; non-breeding floaters.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="id-claim-note"><strong class="claim-science">[science]</strong> species-account and field research data</p>
  </section>

